{
  "title": "Outdoor Grilled Malaysian Chicken Satay",
  "description": "A malty, fluffy, comforting Malaysian dish featuring green-curry-paste, broiled to perfection on a binchotan grill, this recipe is gluten-free-friendly and perfect for outdoor gatherings.",
  "cuisine": "Malaysian",
